      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you explain a bit more?\n\nHere is where I grabbed the driver requirement: https://crrev.com/c/722104/5..7/driver/ppc/sn5s330.c#b101\n\nBut maybe this code is inappropriate and should be removed? The register map section of the spec states that the PP2_FET should be enabled when the device is being initialized from a dead battery.\n\nPerhaps we should make a P3 bug to remove this bit of code?",
